      storyTitleArabic: "مشكلة في خدمة العملاء",
      paragraphs: <String>["Dina ordered a small printer for her home office, but the delivery status showed an unfamiliar address. She opened a support ticket and attached the tracking information.", "The first support agent suggested waiting another day. Dina explained that the delivery photograph showed a different building and asked for a case number to follow the complaint.", "A second agent checked the address record and found a sorting mistake. He arranged a replacement delivery and gave Dina an expected timescale instead of promising an immediate arrival.", "Dina saved the written response and confirmed receipt when the printer arrived. The service follow-up asked whether the issue was resolved, and she praised the clear communication while explaining the initial delay."],
