      storyTitle: "A Trip That Changed Plans",
      storyTitleArabic: "رحلة تغيرت خطتها",
      paragraphs: <String>["While Amal was checking her travel itinerary, a cancellation notice arrived. The ferry crossing to an island had stopped because of rough seas, leaving her group with an unexpected free day.", "Their group leader checked an alternative route, but the next boat was also uncertain. A local guide suggested a walking tour through the old harbor district instead.", "Amal contacted the guesthouse about a delayed check-in and asked whether the first night could be moved. The owner offered a revised stay without an additional booking charge.", "The group kept a travel expense record and compared their new costs that evening. Their alternative activity became a favorite memory, though they still checked the next sailing before making further plans."],
