      title: "A Lesson in Responsibility",
      titleArabic: "درس في المسؤولية",
      storyTitle: "A Lesson in Responsibility",
      storyTitleArabic: "درس في المسؤولية",
      paragraphs: <String>["When a club lent Adam a video camera, he signed an equipment loan form. The club secretary explained the return date and asked him to use the protective bag.", "After filming, Adam left the camera in a shared cupboard instead of the secure locker. The next morning, he discovered a broken lens cover and felt tempted to hide the damage.", "He reported the incident promptly and described his storage mistake. The secretary thanked him for being honest and checked the repair estimate before deciding what to do.", "Adam helped arrange the repair and wrote a borrowing reminder for future users. He understood that taking responsibility meant explaining what happened and helping with a reasonable solution, not simply apologizing and disappearing."],
      storyWords: <EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("video camera", "كاميرا فيديو"), EnglishAdvancedWord("equipment loan form", "استمارة إعارة معدات"), EnglishAdvancedWord("club secretary", "أمين النادي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("return date", "موعد الإرجاع"), EnglishAdvancedWord("protective bag", "حقيبة واقية"), EnglishAdvancedWord("shared cupboard", "خزانة مشتركة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("secure locker", "خزانة آمنة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("broken lens cover", "غطاء عدسة مكسور"), EnglishAdvancedWord("storage mistake", "خطأ تخزين"), EnglishAdvancedWord("repair estimate", "تقدير تكلفة الإصلاح"), EnglishAdvancedWord("borrowing reminder", "تذكير بالإعارة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("reasonable solution", "حل معقول")],
      extraWords: <EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("borrow responsibly", "يستعير بمسؤولية"), EnglishAdvancedWord("damage report", "بلاغ تلف"), EnglishAdvancedWord("loan agreement", "اتفاق إعارة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("equipment care", "العناية بالمعدات"), EnglishAdvancedWord("return on time", "يعيد في الموعد"), EnglishAdvancedWord("admit a mistake", "يعترف بخطأ"), EnglishAdvancedWord("accidental damage", "تلف عرضي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("repair appointment", "موعد إصلاح"), EnglishAdvancedWord("shared property", "ممتلكات مشتركة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("care instructions", "تعليمات العناية"), EnglishAdvancedWord("incident note", "ملاحظة حادث"), EnglishAdvancedWord("personal responsibility", "مسؤولية شخصية"), EnglishAdvancedWord("honest account", "رواية صادقة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("club equipment", "معدات النادي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("late return", "إرجاع متأخر"), EnglishAdvancedWord("protective cover", "غطاء واقٍ"), EnglishAdvancedWord("replacement cost", "تكلفة الاستبدال"), EnglishAdvancedWord("responsible action", "تصرف مسؤول")],
      grammarTitle: "Obligation, advice and choice",
      grammarArabic: "تعبّر must وhave to عن الإلزام، وshould عن النصيحة. must not للمنع، بينما do not have to تعني أن الفعل غير إلزامي.",
      grammarExamples: <String>["Borrowers must use the protective bag.", "You should report damage promptly.", "You must not hide a damaged item."],
      listening: "Before borrowing club equipment, read the loan form and check the item with a staff member. Report any existing damage before you leave so that it can be recorded accurately. If something breaks during your loan, contact the club as soon as possible. Do not try an unfamiliar repair yourself. The secretary will explain the next steps after checking the problem. Returning an item without mentioning damage makes it harder for the next borrower to use it safely.",
      listeningQuestion: "What should borrowers do about damage that already exists?",
      listeningOptions: <String>["Wait for the next borrower to notice", "Report it before leaving", "Repair it secretly"],
      listeningAnswer: 1,
      readingQuestion: "How did Adam show responsibility?",
      readingOptions: <String>["He hid the camera", "He blamed the next borrower", "He reported the damage and helped arrange repair"],
      readingAnswer: 2,
      writingCue: "When a club lent Adam a ____, he signed an equipment loan form.",
      writingAnswer: "video camera",
    ),
